{'symbol': 'NLSN', 'date': '2021-10-15 07:00:00', 'title': 'NIELSEN DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': "NEW YORK, OCT. 15, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE\xa0BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF NIELSEN HOLDINGS PLC (NYSE: NLSN) DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.06 PER SHARE OF NIELSEN'S COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 2, 2021 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON NOVEMBER 18, 2021."}